	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Remitto tibi, ut petis, honorande domine com<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>pater, tuum illud ad <persName ref="p3099">Sultzerum</persName> scriptum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Legit hoc <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>idem <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName> noster et probat candide.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">In loco <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>sane urgetis eum, ut se declaret, qualis, si <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>congrediendum sit cum adversariis, esse velit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Ego mihi semper ab isto homine metui; quotquot <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>enim hic eum norunt penitius, versipellem et <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>valde lubricum esse affirmant.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Rogamus vero, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>si tua gratia fieri possit, ut illius quoque scriptum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ad vos missum nobis communices, nec debes putare <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>nos eo imprudenter usuros; satis nobis erit <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>semel inspexisse illud.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Petimus item, ut occasione <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>tanta vobis oblata non cessetis illum urgere, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>donec se declaret.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">De Decadibus nostris ex <persName ref="p1227">Fro<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>schouero</persName> iuniore cognosces.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Quod res novas <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>attinet, nihil habeo, quod scribam, praeterquam quod <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>rumor hic spargitur de <placeName ref="l2235">Calete</placeName> civitate a <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>capta.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Diser red habend wir aber noch keinen <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>gwüßeren grund dann disen: Am fritag vergangen, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>den 14. januarij, sind min herren, die zuͦ <placeName ref="l167">Genff</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>das burgrecht gschworen haben, zuͦ <placeName>Bätterlingen</placeName> gsin, allda <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>einer uff der post kommen ylends, der semmlichs <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>anzeigt und fürgäben, er yle uff der post zum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName ref="p7255">hertzog von Ferrär</persName>, imm solichs zuͦ verkünden.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Hatt <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>auch anzeigt, wie es zuͦgangen, das nammlich die <lb xml:id="p1z26"/><placeName ref="l832">Frantzosen</placeName> den <placeName ref="l830">Engellenderen</placeName> mitt ettlichen nauen <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>die meerschwellinen abjagt, und als sich die <lb xml:id="p1z28"/><placeName ref="l830">Engellender</placeName> versähen, das aller gwallt deß <placeName ref="l832">Frantzosen</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>uff <placeName ref="l2165">Arras</placeName> zuͦ trucken wurde, habind si sich gwent <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>und ylends mitt fuͦßysen gerüstet, in aller <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>gfrüre uff <placeName ref="l2235">Cales</placeName> zuͦ geylt und es, diewyl nitt <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>wyter volk dann der gmein zuͦsatz darin gsin, in <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>yl eroberet.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Haec ille.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Expectamus tamen certiora.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/><persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName> hisce diebus decubuit, sed per domini <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>gratiam revaluit iterum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat is te et fratres <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>omnes; salvi sint illi meo quoque nomine una cum <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>uxore et familia tua.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 17. ianuarii 1558.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">I[o<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>annes] Hall[erus</persName>] tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae pastori fidelissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino et compatri suo per<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>petuo honore prosequendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
